#: ../../frc-docs/source/docs/software/vscode-overview/deploying-robot-code.rst:24
msgid ""
"If successful, we will see a \"Build Successful\" message (1) and the RioLog"
" will open with the console output from the robot program as it runs (2)."
msgstr ""
"成功したら、「Build "
"Successful」メッセージ（1）が表示され、RioLogがロボットプログラムの実行中にコンソール出力とともに開かれます（2）。"
